{"id":"af80c4c087c85f9a","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-weak-normalization-not-strong.md","title":"有正规形仍可无限归约","display":"ex-weak-normalization-not-strong — 有正规形仍可无限归约","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-weak-normalization-not-strong","aliases":["56-ex-weak-normalization-not-strong"],"display":"ex-weak-normalization-not-strong — 有正规形仍可无限归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","[[56-df-lambda-term]]","[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]","[[56-df-strongly-normalizing]]","[[56-df-normal-form]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Examples 10.1.17(ii)–(iii), printed p552","source_ocr_block":"573","verification_status":"source-example-compared; reductions-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-weak-normalization-not-strong"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-weak-normalization-not-strong</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-weak-normalization-not-strong — 有正规形仍可无限归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"251992a231a52348\" href=\"?note=251992a231a52348\" title=\"56-df-strongly-normalizing\">56-df-strongly-normalizing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Examples 10.1.17(ii)–(iii), printed p552"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"573"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-example-compared; reductions-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在无类型 λ 演算中取互异变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,z,a,b\\in V\">\\(x,z,a,b\\in V\\)</span>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)\">\\(L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\">\\(\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]_\\alpha=[M]_{\\alpha,V^2}\">\\([M]_\\alpha=[M]_{\\alpha,V^2}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta\">\\(\\to_\\beta\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a> 的 α 商上归约关系。下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,I,K,N\">\\(\\Omega,I,K,N\\)</span> 均取商元素；两个商元素的应用和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda b.I\">\\(\\lambda b.I\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a> 的商上构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF},\\mathrm{WNAt},\\mathrm{SNAt}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF},\\mathrm{WNAt},\\mathrm{SNAt}\\)</span> 见相应 ARS 节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\coloneqq[(\\lambda x.xx)(\\lambda x.xx)]_\\alpha,\\qquad I\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.z]_\\alpha,\\qquad K\\coloneqq[\\lambda a.\\lambda b.a]_\\alpha,\\qquad N\\coloneqq KI\\Omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega\\coloneqq[(\\lambda x.xx)(\\lambda x.xx)]_\\alpha,\\qquad I\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.z]_\\alpha,\\qquad K\\coloneqq[\\lambda a.\\lambda b.a]_\\alpha,\\qquad N\\coloneqq KI\\Omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\to_\\beta\\Omega,\\qquad N\\to_\\beta N,\\qquad N\\to_\\beta(\\lambda b.I)\\Omega\\to_\\beta I,\\qquad\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega\\to_\\beta\\Omega,\\qquad N\\to_\\beta N,\\qquad N\\to_\\beta(\\lambda b.I)\\Omega\\to_\\beta I,\\qquad\\mathrm{NF}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WNAt}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,N)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WNAt}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,N)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{SNAt}(\\Lambda,\\to_\\beta,N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Examples 10.1.17(ii)–(iii)（印刷 p552，OCR 页块573）。常规序列可到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>；持续在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Omega\">\\(Omega\\)</span> 子项归约则形成无限自环。明确区分有正规形与所有归约都终止，为终止/策略条目提供退化反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-beta-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]"